{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":30,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":5759,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1686207,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":244956,"Name":"kfarkas26","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244956.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1352923053,"LastPoster":{"Id":286686,"Name":"MeredithLynne","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":57,"Preview":{"Id":1686207,"PostDate":1352923053,"PostContent":"Ok Ladies!!!  \u00a0  I have searched and searched and I have yet to find a thread devoted to what th...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kfarkas26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1315315994,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244956.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kfarkas26","Id":244956,"Name":"kfarkas26","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdd06bfdd51ac95582b41356aaed0b77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ok Ladies!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have searched and searched and I have yet to find a thread devoted to what the GROOM is wearing!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I can not decide what I want my future hubby to wear on our big day (he is a jeans and tshirt guy and has told me several times he doesn&#039;t care what he wears) But i still can not seem to figure out what I would like him (and our fathers and best man to wear)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I figured I&#039;d ask what you ladies are thinking or have already done!! Please help me out! Post pictures and websites... Also my wedding is in June when should i be buying these outfits?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1686207,"PostDate":1352923053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ok Ladies!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have searched and searched and I have yet to find a thread devoted to what the GROOM is wearing!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I can not decide what I want my future hubby to wear on our big day (he is a jeans and tshirt guy and has told me several times he doesn't care what he wears) But i still can not seem to figure out what I would like him (and our fathers and best man to wear)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I figured I'd ask what you ladies are thinking or have already done!! Please help me out! Post pictures and websites... Also my wedding is in June when should i be buying these outfits?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kfarkas26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1315315994,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244956.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kfarkas26","Id":244956,"Name":"kfarkas26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19ffb0f545532b062b844fac83c61030","RawContent":"&lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1352938950209_1343\"&gt; &lt;img data-id=\"171756\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"131\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/171756\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width: 212px; height: 131px;\" width=\"150\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My Fiance and his groomsmen will be wearing this&amp;nbsp;the dark gray vest and pants except they&#039;ll have&amp;nbsp;purple ties! Im pretty excited about it! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1686212,"PostDate":1352925030,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1352938950209_1343\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"171756\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"131\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/171756\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width: 212px; height: 131px;\" width=\"150\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My Fiance and his groomsmen will be wearing this\u00a0the dark gray vest and pants except they'll have\u00a0purple ties! Im pretty excited about it! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Melimelvi86@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"184.6.114.224","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1332346442,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253020.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Melimelvi86","Id":253020,"Name":"Melimelvi86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c34018ae7f8d4f4f67629e1ca2a861ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; There is a thread dedicated to this, i guess it just depends on what words you were using in your search.&amp;nbsp; Any-who, here you go:&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/1058\/post-groom-and-gm-attire\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/1058\/post-groom-and-gm-attire&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1686218,"PostDate":1352928456,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n  